{"id":30009,"artist":"Adele","title":"Adele - Someone Like You","lyrics_plain":null,"lyrics_synced":"[00:08.68] I heard that you're settled down\r\n[00:12.72] That you found a girl and you're married now\r\n[00:17.46] I heard that your dreams came true\r\n[00:23.87] Guess she gave you things I didn't give to you\r\n[00:30.74] Old friend, why are you so shy?\r\n[00:34.27] Ain't like you to hold back or hide from the light\r\n[00:38.63] I hate to turn up out of the blue, uninvited\r\n[00:40.03] But I couldn't stay away, I couldn't fight it\r\n[00:43.09] I had hoped you'd see my face\r\n[00:45.18] And that you'd be reminded that for me, it isn't over\r\n[00:49.55] Never mind, I'll find someone like you\r\n[00:52.80] I wish nothing but the best for you, too\r\n[00:58.93] Don't forget me, I beg\r\n[01:01.43] I'll remember, you said\r\n[01:03.99] Sometimes it lasts in love, but sometimes it hurts instead\r\n[01:07.05] Sometimes it lasts in love, but sometimes it hurts instead\r\n[01:12.58] \r\n[01:13.00] You know how the time flies\r\n[01:17.04] Only yesterday was the time of our lives\r\n[01:21.73] We were born and raised in a summer haze\r\n[01:27.07] Bound by the surprise of our glory days\r\n[01:34.08] I hate to turn up out of the blue, uninvited\r\n[01:36.87] But I couldn't stay away, I couldn't fight it\r\n[01:40.07] I had hoped you'd see my face\r\n[01:42.21] And that you'd be reminded that for me, it isn't over\r\n[01:46.25] \r\n[01:49.36] Never mind, I'll find someone like you\r\n[01:55.07] I wish nothing but the best for you, too\r\n[02:01.62] Don't forget me, I beg\r\n[02:04.22] I'll remember, you said\r\n[02:06.40] Sometimes it lasts in love, but sometimes it hurts instead\r\n[02:13.65] Nothing compares, no worries or cares\r\n[02:18.01] Regrets and mistakes, they're memories made\r\n[02:19.83] Who would have known how bittersweet this would taste?\r\n[02:26.75] \r\n[02:30.04] Never mind, I'll find someone like you\r\n[02:33.94] I wish nothing but the best for you\r\n[02:38.91] Don't forget me, I beg\r\n[02:42.30] I'll remember, you said\r\n[02:43.65] Sometimes it lasts in love, but sometimes it hurts instead\r\n[02:49.69] Never mind, I'll find someone like you\r\n[02:52.52] I wish nothing but the best for you, too\r\n[02:57.16] Don't forget me, I beg\r\n[02:59.58] I'll remember, you said\r\n[03:02.23] Sometimes it lasts in love, but sometimes it hurts instead\r\n[03:05.15] Sometimes it lasts in love, but sometimes it hurts instead...\r\n[03:07.33] ","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:08.68] <00:08.68>I <00:09.35>heard <00:10.03>that <00:10.70>you're <00:11.37>settled <00:12.05>down\n[00:12.72] <00:12.72>That <00:13.25>you <00:13.77>found <00:14.30>a <00:14.83>girl <00:15.35>and <00:15.88>you're <00:16.41>married <00:16.93>now\n[00:17.46] <00:17.46>I <00:18.32>heard <00:19.17>that <00:20.03>your <00:20.89>dreams <00:21.75>came <00:22.60>true\n[00:23.87] <00:23.87>Guess <00:24.47>she <00:25.07>gave <00:25.67>you <00:26.27>things <00:26.87>I <00:27.47>didn't <00:28.07>give <00:28.67>to <00:29.27>you\n[00:30.74] <00:30.74>Old <00:31.24>friend, <00:31.75>why <00:32.25>are <00:32.76>you <00:33.26>so <00:33.77>shy?\n[00:34.27] <00:34.27>Ain't <00:34.67>like <00:35.06>you <00:35.46>to <00:35.86>hold <00:36.25>back <00:36.65>or <00:37.04>hide <00:37.44>from <00:37.84>the <00:38.23>light\n[00:38.63] <00:38.63>I <00:38.77>hate <00:38.91>to <00:39.05>turn <00:39.19>up <00:39.33>out <00:39.47>of <00:39.61>the <00:39.75>blue, <00:39.89>uninvited\n[00:40.03] <00:40.03>But <00:40.37>I <00:40.71>couldn't <00:41.05>stay <00:41.39>away, <00:41.73>I <00:42.07>couldn't <00:42.41>fight <00:42.75>it\n[00:43.09] <00:43.09>I <00:43.39>had <00:43.69>hoped <00:43.99>you'd <00:44.28>see <00:44.58>my <00:44.88>face\n[00:45.18] <00:45.18>And <00:45.58>that <00:45.97>you'd <00:46.37>be <00:46.77>reminded <00:47.17>that <00:47.56>for <00:47.96>me, <00:48.36>it <00:48.76>isn't <00:49.15>over\n[00:49.55] <00:49.55>Never <00:50.01>mind, <00:50.48>I'll <00:50.